   "kind": "howto",
   "stage": ["question"],
   "text": {
    "en": "Grow one trait at a time. Choose one, for example patience, honesty, or gentle speech, and watch for it for a week. The Prophet said the most beloved to him and the closest to him on the Day of Judgement are those with the best character. Small daily choices build it, and the Character course in the app goes through it step by step."
