   "id": "growth_everyday.howto.002",
   "kind": "howto",
   "stage": ["question"],
   "text": {
    "en": "Let the five prayers organise your day. They are decreed at set times, so build your day around them: work and study in the spaces between, and use the minute after each prayer for a short plan for what is next. Many people find the day feels calmer when the prayer is the anchor, not the interruption."
   },
