   "id": "growth_everyday.howto.003",
   "kind": "howto",
   "stage": ["question"],
   "text": {
    "en": "Learn in small steps. Pick one topic you care about, spend ten minutes a day on it, and write down one thing you learned. The Prophet said that if Allah wants good for someone, He gives him understanding of the religion. The Seeking Knowledge guide and the Academy in the app are good places to begin."
   },
