   "id": "growth_everyday.howto.004",
   "kind": "howto",
   "stage": ["question"],
   "text": {
    "en": "Give a little, often. Charity does not decrease wealth, the Prophet said, and forgiveness and humility raise a person in honour. A small sum on a regular day, a meal sent to a neighbour, a kind message, each counts. You can start today with something small enough that you will repeat it."
